* TIMES.jl crafted case demo12_capflo (reference/crafted.toml, 17 Nov 2026): commodity flows tied
* to new capacity and to decommissioning (NCAP_ICOM, NCAP_OCOM, NCAP_CLED: coef_nio.mod L13-67 and
* the second term of cal_cap.mod in EQ(l)_COMBAL and EQ_PEAK; their costs, cal_caps.mod in
* EQ_OBJVAR; M1.3 change 53, docs/m13-plan.md), added to TIMES_Demo demo12
* (etsap-TIMES/TIMES_Demo @ 962db86, CC BY 4.0).
* - ELCTNGAS01 (the new gas plant, vintaged) consumes diesel when built, from two years before
*   it starts (NCAP_CLED), with a flow cost on it, and electricity in REG1 (a peak commodity), and
*   releases ELCCO2 when decommissioned.
* - A past vintage 1995 of the coal plant ELCTECOA00 in REG1 releases ELCCO2 when decommissioned.
$ONEMPTY
$ONEPS
$ONWARNING
PARAMETER
NCAP_ICOM ' '/
REG1.2005.ELCTNGAS01.DSL 2
REG1.2005.ELCTNGAS01.ELC 0.5
REG2.2005.ELCTNGAS01.DSL 1.5
/

PARAMETER
NCAP_CLED ' '/
REG1.2005.ELCTNGAS01.DSL 2
/

PARAMETER
NCAP_PASTI ' '/
REG1.1995.ELCTECOA00 3
/

PARAMETER
NCAP_OCOM ' '/
REG1.2005.ELCTNGAS01.ELCCO2 0.3
REG2.2005.ELCTNGAS01.ELCCO2 0.2
REG1.1995.ELCTECOA00.ELCCO2 0.25
/

PARAMETER
FLO_COST ' '/
REG1.2005.ELCTNGAS01.DSL.ANNUAL.MEURO05 3
/
